tutorial-basics-name = Basic Controls

## Entities

ent-TutorialHoloMentor = N.A.N.C.I.
    .desc = A holographic training intelligence. She is projected from the nearest holopad, and is very pleased you asked.
ent-TutorialHolopad = training holopad
    .desc = A floor-mounted projector. The facility's training intelligence uses it to be in two places at once.
ent-TutorialPointCrate = demonstration crate
    .desc = A crate placed here purely so that you have something to point at.

tutorial-holo-mentor-reproject = The holopad flickers to life.

## Goal titles

tutorial-basics-goal-locomotion = Locomotion Assessment
tutorial-basics-goal-gait = Gait Compliance
tutorial-basics-goal-lowprofile = Low-Profile Operations
tutorial-basics-goal-obstacles = Obstacle Negotiation
tutorial-basics-goal-seating = Seating and Restraint
tutorial-basics-goal-awareness = Situational Awareness
tutorial-basics-goal-access = Access Control
tutorial-basics-goal-certification = Certification

## Chamber 1. movement

tutorial-basics-sg-welcome = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-basics-nanci-welcome-1 = Hello, and welcome to the Nanotrasen Employee Onboarding Facility.
tutorial-basics-nanci-welcome-2 = I am N.A.N.C.I., your Nanotrasen Automated Neophyte Competency Instructor.
tutorial-basics-nanci-welcome-3 = You have been successfully removed from cryosleep.
tutorial-basics-nanci-welcome-4 = Statistically speaking, that was the hard part.

tutorial-basics-sg-move-any = Move.
tutorial-basics-control-move-any = Use [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveUp"][/bold][/color] [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveLeft"][/bold][/color] [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveDown"][/bold][/color] [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveRight"][/bold][/color] to move.
tutorial-basics-nanci-move-any-1 = We begin with locomotion.
tutorial-basics-nanci-move-any-2 = Please attempt to move.
tutorial-basics-nanci-move-any-3 = Take your time.
tutorial-basics-nanci-move-any-4 = This chamber is rated for eight hours of unoccupied standing, and I have all day.

tutorial-basics-sg-reach-pad-1 = Walk to the far end of the chamber.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-1-1 = Excellent. You are mobile.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-1-2 = That already places you ahead of two of last cycle's applicants.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-1-3 = Proceed to the far end of this chamber.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-1-4 = The exit is the door shaped hole in the wall.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-1-5 = I mention this because someone once asked.

## Chamber 2. walking

tutorial-basics-sg-gait-intro = Step further into the chamber.
tutorial-basics-nanci-gait-intro-1 = I will be accompanying you.
tutorial-basics-nanci-gait-intro-2 = Not physically.
tutorial-basics-nanci-gait-intro-3 = I am projected from the holopads you will find in every chamber.
tutorial-basics-nanci-gait-intro-4 = It is considerably more efficient than walking.
tutorial-basics-nanci-gait-intro-5 = Move onto the yellow sqaure to begin the next test.

tutorial-basics-sg-walk-toggle = Walk instead of running.
tutorial-basics-control-walk-toggle = Use [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="Walk"][/bold][/color] to walk.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-toggle-1 = Your default mode of movement is a sprint.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-toggle-2 = Slippery obstacles require you to not sprint.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-toggle-3 = Please demonstrate a controlled walk to avoid slippage.

tutorial-basics-sg-walk-lane = Cross the lane at a walk.
tutorial-basics-control-walk-lane = Keep [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="Walk"][/bold][/color] engaged while you move.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-lane-1 = Maintain that pace to the end.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-lane-2 = Slowly. Deliberately.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-lane-3 = Like someone with a pension to protect.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-lane-4 = Sprinting is how we lost applicants four through eleven.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-lane-5 = Not to the sprinting itself, but to what was on the floor.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-retry = Catastrophic slippage detected, I have returned you to the start of the lane, try again at walking pace.

tutorial-basics-sg-walk-done = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-done-1 = Compliance achieved.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-done-2 = You may stop walking now.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-done-3 = Your certificate of Gait Compliance is being printed somewhere.
tutorial-basics-nanci-walk-done-4 = Continue on into the next chamber.

## Chamber 3. crawling

tutorial-basics-sg-lie-down = Lie down.
tutorial-basics-control-lie-down = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ToggleKnockdown"][/bold][/color] to lie down.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-1 = Sometimes being tall is a liability.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-2 = It is a liability right now, in fact.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-3 = Sometimes you need to lie down.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-4 = Either to avoid lethal projectiles.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-5 = Or to cry in sorrow.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-6 = Those plastic flaps require you to lie down.
tutorial-basics-nanci-lie-down-7 = Please lie down.

tutorial-basics-sg-crawl-lane = Crawl to the end.
tutorial-basics-control-crawl-lane = Move while lying down to crawl.
tutorial-basics-nanci-crawl-lane-1 = Good.
tutorial-basics-nanci-crawl-lane-2 = Now crawl under the flaps.
tutorial-basics-nanci-crawl-lane-3 = You are now slower and considerably less dignified.
tutorial-basics-nanci-crawl-lane-4 = You are also alive.
tutorial-basics-nanci-crawl-lane-5 = Nanotrasen has a strong institutional preference for being alive.

tutorial-basics-sg-stand-up = Stand back up.
tutorial-basics-control-stand-up = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ToggleKnockdown"][/bold][/color] again to stand up.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-up-1 = You may stand.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-up-2 = It takes a moment.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-up-3 = Do not panic during that moment.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-up-4 = Panicking does not make it faster.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-up-5 = We tested.

tutorial-basics-sg-stand-done = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-done-1 = Welcome back to the upright.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-done-2 = You have completed the low-profile operations.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-done-3 = Continue to the next chamber.

## Chamber 4. climbing

tutorial-basics-sg-climb-table = Climb onto the table.
tutorial-basics-control-climb-table = Drag yourself onto the table, or press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="AltActivateItemInWorld"][/bold][/color].
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-1 = This chamber contains a table.
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-2 = The table is between you and the exit.
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-3 = Usually you walk around a table.
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-4 = This is not possible in this chamber.
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-5 = Climb onto the table.
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-6 = Yes, you may stand on the furniture.
tutorial-basics-nanci-climb-table-7 = This is the single greatest perk of your employment package.

tutorial-basics-sg-reach-pad-4 = Continue to the far end.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-4-1 = Note that glass tables do not enjoy this.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-4-2 = Neither did applicant six.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reach-pad-4-3 = Continue to the far end of the chamber.

## Chamber 5. chairs

tutorial-basics-sg-sit-down = Sit on the chair.
tutorial-basics-control-sit-down = Click a chair to sit down.
tutorial-basics-nanci-sit-down-1 = You have been walking for some minutes.
tutorial-basics-nanci-sit-down-2 = Nanotrasen values your wellbeing.
tutorial-basics-nanci-sit-down-3 = We calculate that a seated employee files four percent fewer complaints.
tutorial-basics-nanci-sit-down-4 = Sit.

tutorial-basics-sg-stand-from-chair = Unbuckle yourself.
tutorial-basics-control-stand-from-chair = Click the buckle alert on your HUD, or click the chair again, to get up.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-from-chair-1 = The restraints are for your safety.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-from-chair-2 = They are also why applicant nine is still in that chair.
tutorial-basics-nanci-stand-from-chair-3 = Release yourself.

## Chamber 6. camera and pointing

tutorial-basics-sg-rotate-camera = Rotate your view.
tutorial-basics-control-rotate-camera = Use [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="CameraRotateLeft"][/bold][/color] and [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="CameraRotateRight"][/bold][/color] to rotate your view.
tutorial-basics-nanci-rotate-camera-1 = This chamber was installed by contractors.
tutorial-basics-nanci-rotate-camera-2 = It is, as you can see, made in the wrong orientation.
tutorial-basics-nanci-rotate-camera-3 = Correcting the chamber would be expensive.
tutorial-basics-nanci-rotate-camera-4 = Instead we have given you the ability to rotate your own perception.
tutorial-basics-nanci-rotate-camera-5 = That is free.

tutorial-basics-sg-reset-camera = Reset your view.
tutorial-basics-control-reset-camera = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="CameraReset"][/bold][/color] to reset your view.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reset-camera-1 = Now put it back.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reset-camera-2 = Employees who leave their view rotated report a sixty percent increase in walking into walls.
tutorial-basics-nanci-reset-camera-3 = The other forty percent do not file reports.

tutorial-basics-sg-point-at = Point at the crate.
tutorial-basics-control-point-at = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="Point"][/bold][/color] and click something to point at it.
tutorial-basics-nanci-point-at-1 = Finally, communication.
tutorial-basics-nanci-point-at-2 = You will likely spend much of your career unable to explain what you are looking at.
tutorial-basics-nanci-point-at-3 = Point at the crate.
tutorial-basics-nanci-point-at-4 = The universal language anyone will understand.
tutorial-basics-nanci-point-at-5 = It is by far the most eloquent thing most of you will ever do.

## Chamber 7. doors

tutorial-basics-sg-open-door = Open the door.
tutorial-basics-control-open-door = Click a door, press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInWorld"][/bold][/color] on it, or walk into it, to open it.
tutorial-basics-nanci-open-door-1 = Doors.
tutorial-basics-nanci-open-door-2 = Nanotrasen has many.
tutorial-basics-nanci-open-door-3 = Most of them will open for you.
tutorial-basics-nanci-open-door-4 = The ones that do not are usually a hint.
tutorial-basics-nanci-open-door-5 = Open this one.

tutorial-basics-sg-take-crowbar = Pick up the crowbar.
tutorial-basics-control-take-crowbar = Click an item to pick it up.
tutorial-basics-nanci-take-crowbar-1 = This next door is unpowered.
tutorial-basics-nanci-take-crowbar-2 = It will not open for you, no matter how sincerely you click it.
tutorial-basics-nanci-take-crowbar-3 = There is a crowbar on the floor.
tutorial-basics-nanci-take-crowbar-4 = The crowbar is the answer to a remarkable number of questions aboard our stations.

tutorial-basics-sg-pry-door = Pry the dead door open.
tutorial-basics-control-pry-door = Click the door while holding the crowbar.
tutorial-basics-nanci-pry-door-1 = Apply the crowbar to the door.
tutorial-basics-nanci-pry-door-2 = Firmly.
tutorial-basics-nanci-pry-door-3 = It will take a moment.
tutorial-basics-nanci-pry-door-4 = Nothing takes zero moments.

## Chamber 8. graduation

tutorial-basics-sg-graduation = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-basics-nanci-graduation-1 = That concludes basic training.
tutorial-basics-nanci-graduation-2 = You can move, walk, crawl, climb, sit, look around, point, and open a door.
tutorial-basics-nanci-graduation-3 = Congratulations, employee.
tutorial-basics-nanci-graduation-4 = You are now more qualified than roughly a third of the current Science department.

tutorial-basics-sg-farewell = Finish the tutorial.
tutorial-basics-nanci-farewell-1 = Your assignments aboard the station begin shortly.
tutorial-basics-nanci-farewell-2 = Please remember that workplace fatalities are preventable.
tutorial-basics-nanci-farewell-3 = But workplace fatalities can also be extremely funny.
tutorial-basics-nanci-farewell-4 = Have a productive shift and enjoy your cake.
